      "label": "漢紀五十七·孝獻皇帝庚·建安十三年",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/漢紀57/建安十三年",
      "layerRole": "structure"
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-alliance",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hanji57",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "孙权定策与孙刘联合出兵",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/孙权定策",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "遂以周瑜、程普為左右督，將兵與備并力逆操；以魯肅為贊軍校尉，助畫方略。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-red-cliffs-contact",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hanji57",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "联军与曹操相遇于赤壁",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/赤壁接战",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "進，與操遇於赤壁。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-hu-comment",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-red-cliffs-contact",
      "nodeType": "commentary",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "胡三省赤壁地理注",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/赤壁接战/胡注",
      "layerRole": "commentary",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "commentary",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "赤壁山，在蒲圻西百三十里，北岸烏林，與赤壁相對。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-hu-quote-shuijingzhu",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hu-comment",
      "nodeType": "quoted_fragment",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "胡三省注引《水經注》赤壁山",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/赤壁接战/胡注引水經注",
      "layerRole": "quoted_fragment",
      "attribution": {
        "workId": "019f24ee-4c8f-7a20-8b5b-8795d01af006",
        "type": "explicit_citation",
        "text": "水經注"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "quotation",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "江水自沙羨而東，右逕赤壁山北。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-disease-fire",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hanji57",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "疾疫、初战、黄盖火攻与曹军大坏",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/赤壁火攻",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "時操軍眾已有疾疫。初一交戰，操軍不利，引次江北。瑜等在南岸。瑜部將黃蓋曰：今寇眾我寡，難與持久。操軍方連船艦，首尾相接，可燒而走也。乃取蒙衝鬥艦十艘，載燥荻、枯柴，灌油其中。去北軍二里餘，同時發火，火烈風猛，燒盡北船，延及岸上營落。人馬燒溺死者甚眾，北軍大壞。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-huarong-retreat",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hanji57",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "曹操经华容道退军",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/华容退军",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "操引軍從華容道步走，遇泥濘，道不通。悉使羸兵負草填之，騎乃得過。羸兵為人馬所蹈藉，陷泥中，死者甚眾。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "zztj-v65-nanjun-aftermath",
      "parentKey": "zztj-v65-hanji57",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "追击至南郡、留守江陵与北还",
      "locatorPath": "卷65/建安十三年/南郡后续",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "劉備、周瑜水陸並進，追操至南郡。時操軍兼以饑疫，死者太半。操乃留征南將軍曹仁、橫野將軍徐晃守江陵，折衝將軍樂進守襄陽，引軍北還。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
